  iadas:perspectives "Future study should analyze samples of both genders. Future studies should categorize athletes involved in leanness sports and non leanness sports. Sports anxiety and level of athletic participation should also be considered. Further studies should analyze if heightened body image ideals internalization causes an increase in negative psychological behavioral and physical consequences such as body dissatisfaction, disordered eating, physical health complaints. ";
