  iadas:hasSport <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance>;
  iadas:limites "The cross sectional nature of the design meant that data were not examined causally. Self report nature of the constructs. ";
  iadas:numberOfSportStudied "One";
  iadas:perspectives "Future studies should endeavor to examine an even wider range of potential predictors of disordered eating attitudes, and do so longitudinally where possible. In addition to BMI, variables that were not considered in the present study but may have been suggested or shown to be important elsewhere include physical self perceptions, the motivational climate, sexual orientation, and possible victimization as a result of being different, for example homosexual boys in dance may be at particular risk. ";
  iadas:relationDegree " r=.24, p<.05";
