  iadas:limites "The cross-sectional design limits causal interpretation, and the use of self-reported measures, lack of clinical diagnoses, and missing data on competition level or physical activity may affect accuracy and generalizability";
  iadas:numberOfSportStudied "Multiple";
  iadas:perspectives "Future research should use longitudinal designs and include more detailed sport-related variables (e.g., competition level, training intensity) to better understand the mechanisms linking sports participation and mental health";
  iadas:relationDegree "r=-.327, p<.001";
