<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Analysis_2008> a iadas:Analysis;
  iadas:analysisId "2008";
  iadas:authorConclusion "Perfectionism in athletes is linked to higher stress, eating disturbances, and body perception issues, with women showing higher stress, emotional eating, and restrictive eating behaviors. Emotional states significantly influence eating patterns, highlighting the need for psychological and nutritional support in sports contexts";
