  iadas:numberOfSportStudied "Multiple";
  iadas:perspectives "Further research on cntextual body images is needed to evaluate the impact of these dual body images with Female athletes not only while in sport, but while away or retiring from sport, inclusding periods of injury, between seasons and when completing sport. ";
  iadas:relationDegree "r=.276, p<.01";
