    <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/track%20and%20field>;
  iadas:limites "Small sample size. The reliability scores for some of the dependant variables was not as robust as it could have been, and the measure for the media viewing was not as precise as it could have been. ";
  iadas:numberOfSportStudied "Multiple";
  iadas:perspectives "Future projects should continue to examine sports media exposure and sports participation as a possibly mediating variable in the media-body image distorsion relationship. ";
