    <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/handball>;
  iadas:limites "The cross-sectional design, small sample size, and reliance on self-reported data limit causal inference and generalizability. Lack of control for key variables (e.g., age, sport type) may also influence results.";
  iadas:numberOfSportStudied "Multiple";
  iadas:perspectives "Future research should use longitudinal and multi-informant designs to clarify causal pathways. Interventions targeting coaching styles, self-compassion, and support services are promising strategies to prevent disordered eating in athletes.";
