<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Analysis_868> a iadas:Analysis;
  iadas:analysisId "868";
  iadas:authorConclusion "The EDE-Q global score was positively associated with weight-related coach pressure, anxiety, taske orientation, impression motivation and threat perception, and negatively associated with less satisfaction with body shape and physical appearance. Eating behaviour was predicted by lower satisfaction with body shape and physical appearance, and higher anxiety and impression motivation. ";
  iadas:complexityOfAnalysis "Simple analyses";
  iadas:groupStatisticalAnalysis "Correlation";
  iadas:hasPopulation <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Population_868>;
  iadas:hasRelation <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Relations_868>;
  iadas:hasSport <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Athletics>, <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/basketball>,
    <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/handball>, <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/karate>,
    <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/swimming>, <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/taekwondo>,
    <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/volleyball>;
  iadas:limites "Data were based on athletes self-report, which could have resulted in under-reporting of eating disordered behaviours. A better discrimination between sports according to their requirements needs to be introduced in order to better differentiate the demands and soecific characteristics of each sport. It is vital to further explore the impact of psychological factors on eating disordered behaviours.";
  iadas:numberOfSportStudied "Multiple";
  iadas:perspectives "It is important to assess athletes reactions in competition, the way they perceive themselves, and the way they want others to perceive them. If there is a better comprehension of these factors, then prevention of eating problems and promotion of better experiences in sport becomes easier to achieve.";
  iadas:relationDegree "r=.26, p<.001";
  iadas:relationDirection "+";
  iadas:sampleSizeMobilized "290";
  iadas:sportPracticeType "Mixed sport";
  iadas:sportSubcategory "Multisport ";
  iadas:typeOfAnalysis "Correlation" .

