  iadas:authorConclusion "For both males and Females, negative perfectionism was moderately and positively correlated with SPA, while positive perfectionism was unrelated to SPA. For males athletes, negative perfectionism and SPA made no contribution to the prediction of disturbed eating attitudes. A mild inverse relationship was found between positive perfectionism and disturbed eating atitudes among male athletes. ";
