  iadas:hasSubgroup """19 athletes with eating disorders
33 without disordered eating""";
  iadas:inclusionCriteria "High performance Female athletes with disordered eating ; competing on national or international levels ; control without disordered eating. Subjects with disordered eating meet two of the major criteria: amaleorrhoea, low BMI or low body fat, purging methods, and bulimic episodes, in addition to two of the following minor criteria: fear of weight gain, feelings of fatness, maintained low weight and increased importance of weight/shape. If participants did not meet these criteria, they were placed in the control group without disordered eating. ";
  iadas:population "Athletes";
  iadas:sampleSize "52";
  iadas:sportLevel "Competitive";
  iadas:sportingPopulation "National and international" .

