  iadas:hasSubgroup """Female fitness athletes (FA)
Recreationally active Female (FR)
T1 = pre-competition
T2 = at competition
T3 = post competition""";
  iadas:inclusionCriteria "Participants fitness and body building athletes ; all responding Female fitness athletes planning to participate in the upcoming Norwegian competition period and initiating an energy restricted diet for such attendance, aged 18-40 years were included. Recreationally active Female at comparable age, with a body mass index of 18.5-35, and with no former of planned future experience with fitness or bodybuilding sports, or current profession as a personal trainer were included. For references athletes additional criterion was being recreationally physically active within any kind of sport/activity at least two times per week during the current year.";
  iadas:population "Athletes";
  iadas:sampleSize "61";
  iadas:sportLevel "Recreational";
  iadas:sportingPopulation "N.A." .

